; Extension §2's own reach relation, over the derived category of
; rules_base.writ: reflexivity from `situation`, one step from `edge`. It is the
; recursion that makes the modalities two-line derivations, and it is the file
; that proves a situation is a bare non-negative index in and out (§9) — no
; entity name appears in either column.

(relation reach 2)
(rule (reach S S) (situation S))
(rule (reach S T) (edge E S M) (reach M T))
